@ANIMAL_PRODUCT_NAME@ @ANIMAL_VERSION@ (@ANIMAL_PLATFORM@)
================================================================

Start: @ANIMAL_START@

Controls (change them in Settings > Controls)
  Move          Arrow keys / WASD          Left stick / D-pad
  Jump          Space / Z                  A (South)
  Climb, dive   Up / Down                  Stick / D-pad
  Map           M                          View / Back
  Throw dynamite X                         X / Square (West)
  Pause         Escape / P                 Menu / Start
  Fullscreen    F11 or Alt+Enter

Your save, settings, log files and crash reports are kept in
  @ANIMAL_USER_DIR@
Deleting that folder starts the game afresh.

If the game reports a damaged data.pak, download the package again.
The files of this package and their SHA-256 hashes are listed in manifest.json.
